  "details": "# Issue:\nI'm not 100% sure if this is VRChat's fault or SteamVR's fault, but if both of your controllers turn off because of the battery being empty, VRChat and SteamVR will crash.\nI'm not really able to verify what exactly causes it because letting my controllers run out of battery multiple times is uhm, a bit time consuming. I've added my output log below though.\n# Setup:\nSteamVR 1.22.13 (Live Version)\nVRChat Build 1222 (Open Beta)\nValve Index + 3x Vive Tracker 2.0\n# Attachments:\nHere is my output log from that session: https://gist.github.com/DrBlackRat/7a546c03074e557f6252b3b9d3b10b48",
